            <dct:description>Using a custom export of the Continuous Plankton Recorder Survey (Helaouët 2026) we aggregated taxa according to their feeding mode (herbivore, carnivore, omnivore and detritivore) and gridded the abundances of those across a 2D (lat-lon) grid at 0.083 deg. resolution. This dataset is part of the DIVE project. Reference Pierre Helaouët (Marine Biological Association of the United Kingdom) (2026): CPR Data request - PredictionZooplankton - 31/03/2026. The Archive for Marine Species and Habitats Data (DASSH). (Dataset). https://doi.org/10.17031/69cb95bb0af84</dct:description>
